1288: <li>In-memory LRU (default 20 entries, ~4 MB worst case) caches per-line hashes for <code>read</code>/<code>edit</code>/<code>grep</code>; entries are re-validated against file <code>mtime</code>, so cache hits silently invalidate on external edits</li>
