prompts/skills/super-research/references/benchmark-comparison.md:12:4. **Fairness budget**: Equal effort per candidate — e.g. "default config only" or "≤15 min of tuning each", and a fixed number of repetitions per cell for variance. If one candidate needs special-casing to run at all (an adapter, a format conversion), that's allowed but logged; it is itself a finding about integration cost.
