docs/changelog.md:5:## 0.12.7
docs/changelog.md:6:
docs/changelog.md:88:- `cast web <typo of stop|status>` no longer silently starts a new server daemon — any unrecognized subcommand now errors instead of falling through to the default "start" behavior.
docs/changelog.md:89:- `cast upgrade --<typo of --force>` no longer silently attempts to upgrade to a "version" named after the mistyped flag — unknown flags now error before that logic runs.
docs/changelog.md:90:- `/ssh <typo of add|remove>` (terminal UI) no longer silently falls back to listing hosts — unrecognized subcommands now error.
docs/changelog.md:804:- Docs: provider credentials are configured only via `~/.cast/settings.json` / `/provider` — the `PROVIDER_BASE_URL` / `PROVIDER_API_KEY` environment variables were documented but never read; the docs no longer claim otherwise.
docs/changelog.md:805:- Minimum Node.js version raised from 18 to 22 (required by undici 8.x used for MCP SSE transport).
docs/changelog.md:806:
docs/changelog.md:993:
docs/changelog.md:994:- Changelog page with version history from 0.1.0 to 0.5.4
docs/changelog.md:995:- Sequential prev/next navigation on all documentation pages (reading loop: Getting Started → ... → Changelog → Getting Started)

